{"2733280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Surfers Code", "steam_appid": 2733280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you are surfing at your local break, and you see waves off in the distance. You can’t help but wonder what do those breaks have to offer? Get a jet ski, get a map, talk to locals, and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/1da9ea7942a133fccbff975c2b35a70a.poster.avif?t=1778378224\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/1da9ea7942a133fccbff975c2b35a70a.webm?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/1da9ea7942a133fccbff975c2b35a70a.mp4?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a chain of tropical islands by foot, boat, and jet ski. Each island has its own break, its own characters, and its own story. If you want to dive deeper into the lore of the islands, explore by foot and interact with locals. If you want to surf, jet ski to a variety of breaks, free surf for high wave scores, or run contests and get on leaderboards. How much you explore or surf is up to you. The world is your oyster, or uh? maybe your turtle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/51c22a945ed2bfd836702377b2cd5b3a.poster.avif?t=1778378224\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/51c22a945ed2bfd836702377b2cd5b3a.webm?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/51c22a945ed2bfd836702377b2cd5b3a.mp4?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lore of the islands get exposed through the interaction with the locals. You will find the pirate captains dilemma, the meaning of surfers code, the shapers secrets, and explore ancient temples, lighthouses, and more as you explore the islands and dodge danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/a7a7ee3a3117208ef901fbffcea5b283.poster.avif?t=1778378224\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/a7a7ee3a3117208ef901fbffcea5b283.webm?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/a7a7ee3a3117208ef901fbffcea5b283.mp4?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surfing is expression based physics simulation with one button control. Reading the wave and timing your turns is what separates the kooks from the pros. There is no correct way to surf the waves. The wave scoring and leaderboards will keep track of your progress and track your improvement. Both novice and pro players will enjoy the addictive experience of mastering a novel and unique surfing mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/25e11388fa5b54150f4a6b6b8800431c.poster.avif?t=1778378224\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/25e11388fa5b54150f4a6b6b8800431c.webm?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/25e11388fa5b54150f4a6b6b8800431c.mp4?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new surf breaks across multiple islands, from long point breaks to shifty beach breaks, shallow reefs, and big wave spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your quiver. Boards aren't cosmetic, they change how the wave feels under your feet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a jet ski and push out to the outer islands where the real mysteries start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on leaderboards at every break, or just surf for the score of it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the right people, read the right journals, and the mysteries of the islands start to unravel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a surf game with a mystery underneath it. Or a mystery game where you surf your way to the truth. Either way, the waves don’t care what you call it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/2f1e5acbe4c8b8c81958918967456f7d.poster.avif?t=1778378224\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/2f1e5acbe4c8b8c81958918967456f7d.webm?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/2f1e5acbe4c8b8c81958918967456f7d.mp4?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FAQ section</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why am I talking to a Seagull?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer: I don't know. Go and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any more questions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer: Uh? No.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/d113455ddbbdfcaaf949b9ed65bce0fc.poster.avif?t=1778378224\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/d113455ddbbdfcaaf949b9ed65bce0fc.webm?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/d113455ddbbdfcaaf949b9ed65bce0fc.mp4?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not bound to one explorer. Choose from a variety of players. But know that each player affects the physics in the game. Change players and change the feel of the game, especially in the surfing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/3640b72f35fc12d136182fc19bf353d1.avif?t=1778378224\" width=512 height=230 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you are surfing at your local break, and you see waves off in the distance. You can’t help but wonder what do those breaks have to offer? Get a jet ski, get a map, talk to locals, and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/1da9ea7942a133fccbff975c2b35a70a.poster.avif?t=1778378224\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/1da9ea7942a133fccbff975c2b35a70a.webm?t=1778378224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733280/extras/1